  "question": {
    "text": "Two bulbs consume the same power when operated at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>200</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>300</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math> respectively. When these bulbs are connected in series across a DC source of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>400</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math>, then the ratio of power consumed across them is",
